OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: Media loads complete SD and internal libraries and keeps capacity visible during playback. Redesigned Multiview with a camera settings panel and cleaner Wi-Fi setup. Double-tap to track, joystick sizes, glass pills and boxless tabs. Shutter angle holds when FPS changes. Includes LEVEL, experimental Action 6 and lower CPU use. Fixes Live View crashes, video freezes, Nano zoom, clip deletion and portrait Recenter. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
